/// (`../sts2-wiki/decompiled/v0.103.2/MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.Cards/Rend.cs:39-45`):
/// `power.TypeForCurrentAmount == PowerType.Debuff && !(power is ITemporaryPower)`.
/// `ITemporaryPower` is implemented by `TemporaryStrengthPower` /
/// `TemporaryFocusPower` / `TemporaryDexterityPower` and their subclasses.
/// The previous note here ("none of which are debuffs anyway") was WRONG and
