/// — ARE debuffs (`TypeForCurrentAmount == Debuff`) yet are `ITemporaryPower`,
/// so C# Rend EXCLUDES them from the count. A pure `is_debuff_for_amount`
/// filter wrongly counted e.g. `DarkShackles(15)` as a debuff. We therefore
/// also exclude `is_temporary_power_debuff` to mirror `!(power is
/// ITemporaryPower)`. (The Focus/Dexterity `ITemporaryPower` subclasses and the
/// positive Strength ones are buffs, already excluded by `is_debuff_for_amount`.)
