/// Bead `sts2-rs-r9s6u`: the prior body additionally required
/// `duration != AfflictionDuration::TurnEnd` (Python pin
/// `stack_type != DURATION`). The Python pin is wrong vs C#:
/// `AfflictionDuration::TurnEnd` covers Vulnerable/Weak/Frail/NoBlock/
/// Shrink/Knockdown/Hang/Shadowmeld/Entangled/Confused/Fasten/NoDraw,
/// all of which C# Rend counts (they aren't `ITemporaryPower`). The
/// filter undercounted by every TurnEnd debuff present on the target.
