/// Bead `sts2-rs-rend-misery-signed-debuff-llzzt`: C# counts by `TypeForCurrentAmount`
/// (`Rend.cs:33` → `PowerModel.GetTypeForAmount`), which is sign-sensitive:
/// a negative-amount Strength/Dexterity/Focus (an `AllowNegative` Counter
